      "name": "Punish Imperfection",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature within Uri's reach fails an attack roll, saving throw, or skill check\n\n---\n\nEffect Uri makes an unarmed Strike against the triggering creature. If the attack hits, the target must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save save or become Enfeebled 3 until the end of its next turn (Enfeebled 4 on a critical failure)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Reactionary",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Uri can use 2 reactions in a round, but he can't perform the same reaction more than once per round."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Slash and Slam",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Uri makes two Strikes: one with his scimitar and one with his shield spikes. If both hit, the overwhelming power of the attack leaves the target Stunned 1 (Stunned 2 if one of the Strikes was a critical hit, or Stunned 3 if both Strikes were critical hits). These Strikes count as one attack for Uri's multiple attack penalty, and the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Swift Capture",
