      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "attack",
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Uri has manacles in his possession and is adjacent to a creature\n\n---\n\nEffect Uri sheathes a weapon he's carrying, then attempts to bind the creature's wrists or ankles with the manacles. If Uri succeeds at an attack roll with a +36 modifier against the target's AC, he applies the manacles.",
